          "name": "check_answer_grounding",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:0ed82e25f1738da3784d29a9c2c672e3c178c48b7c79abe91d29618c726e1885",
          "description": "Deterministically check a single answer against the context it should be grounded in: required facts (anchors) present, every number traceable to the context, abstention when the question is unanswerable. Same logic as the CI gate — no model, no network. Returns pass/fail with named issues.",
